"body": "A shared page drawn at 400px sat in the top of a 730px-tall preview card with most of the box empty.\n\nOnly when the viewer is inside a card, it measures what the page actually draws and enlarges it to fit the box, 2.2 times at most. A page that already fills the box is left alone, and a page opened on its own is untouched. The enlarging runs inside the same locked frame as the page.\n\nLocal build, 8 previews looked at by eye: the 5 small pages now fill their boxes, the 3 full pages are unchanged, and the tap still lands on the enlarged page (free throw: 'Swish! 1 / 1').",
